#4471 was marked as one known date problem. The exported reports show two independent causes, so
each now has its own engineering ticket.

## What the export shows

<IssueSplit
  parserIssue="https://github.com/auguscim/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1"
  hintIssue="https://github.com/auguscim/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2"
/>

## Why split it

The parser error affects every report from a day-first tenant except booking-v3 form reports.
The booking-v3 hint is a separate form problem: it tells people to enter a month-first date and
then interprets that input in the tenant's day-first locale. One fix cannot safely stand in for the
other.

